    "toc_article_FKA4Ri": {
      "type": "toc-article",
      "blocks": {
        "chapter_9gKj6e": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. Introduction",
            "text": "<p>This Cookie Policy explains how Handel (Ningbo) Electronic Commerce Co., Ltd., trading as PB Fulfill, uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit:<br/><br/>https://pbfulfill.com<br/><br/>In this Cookie Policy, “PB Fulfill,” “we,” “us,” and “our” refer to Handel (Ningbo) Electronic Commerce Co., Ltd.<br/><br/>This Cookie Policy should be read together with our Privacy Policy:<br/><br/>https://pbfulfill.com/pages/privacy-policy<br/><br/>Our Privacy Policy explains more broadly how we collect, use, disclose, store, and protect personal information.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_WfnLfY": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. What Are Cookies?",
            "text": "<p>Cookies are small text files that a website places or stores on your browser or device.<br/><br/>Cookies can allow a website to recognize a browser or device, remember information about a visit, provide essential functions, understand website performance, and support analytics or marketing activities.<br/><br/>Some cookies are deleted when you close your browser. These are commonly called session cookies.<br/><br/>Other cookies remain on your browser or device for a defined period or until you delete them. These are commonly called persistent cookies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_qc9fga": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Similar Technologies ",
            "text": "<p>In addition to cookies, we and our service providers may use similar technologies, including:</p><p> </p><p>• Pixels;</p><p>• Tags;</p><p>• Web beacons;</p><p>• Local storage;</p><p>• Software development kits;</p><p>• Device identifiers;</p><p>• Embedded scripts; and</p><p>• Other technologies that store or access information on a browser or device.</p><p> </p><p>In this Cookie Policy, references to “cookies” generally include these similar technologies where appropriate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_jGbkBc": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Why We Use Cookies ",
            "text": "<p>We may use cookies and similar technologies to:</p><p> </p><p>• Operate our website;</p><p>• Provide essential website functions;</p><p>• Maintain website security;</p><p>• Prevent fraud and misuse;</p><p>• Remember your preferences;</p><p>• Support forms and account functionality;</p><p>• Understand how visitors use our website;</p><p>• Measure website and page performance;</p><p>• Identify technical errors;</p><p>• Understand how visitors reached our website;</p><p>• Measure marketing or campaign performance where enabled; and</p><p>• Personalize content or marketing where permitted.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_PXNrmJ": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. Categories of Cookies We Use ",
            "text": "<h3>5.1 Necessary Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Necessary cookies support essential website functions and cannot generally be disabled through our cookie preference controls.</p><p> </p><p>They may be used to:</p><p> </p><p>• Load and display website pages;</p><p>• Maintain website and network security;</p><p>• Prevent fraud and malicious activity;</p><p>• Remember privacy and cookie choices;</p><p>• Support account login;</p><p>• Maintain a shopping cart or checkout session where applicable;</p><p>• Process forms;</p><p>• Balance website traffic; and</p><p>• Provide other functions that are necessary for the website or a service requested by the user.</p><p> </p><p>Disabling necessary cookies through your browser may cause parts of the website to stop working correctly.</p><p> </p><h3>5.2 Preference Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Preference cookies allow the website to remember choices that affect how the website operates or appears.</p><p> </p><p>They may be used to remember:</p><p> </p><p>• Language;</p><p>• Country or region;</p><p>• Display settings;</p><p>• Previously selected options; and</p><p>• Other website preferences.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law, we will request consent before using non-essential preference cookies.</p><p> </p><h3>5.3 Analytics Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Analytics cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website.</p><p> </p><p>They may collect information about:</p><p> </p><p>• Pages visited;</p><p>• Time spent on pages;</p><p>• Links and buttons clicked;</p><p>• Referring pages or sources;</p><p>• Browser and device type;</p><p>• Approximate location;</p><p>• Website errors;</p><p>• Page performance; and</p><p>• General visitor and session trends.</p><p> </p><p>We may use this information to improve website performance, content, navigation, and user experience.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law, analytics cookies will be used only after you provide consent.</p><p> </p><h3>5.4 Marketing Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Marketing cookies may be used where advertising or campaign-measurement services are enabled.</p><p> </p><p>They may help us or our service providers:</p><p> </p><p>• Measure the effectiveness of campaigns;</p><p>• Understand whether a visitor completed an inquiry or other conversion;</p><p>• Associate website visits with marketing sources;</p><p>• Limit repeated advertising;</p><p>• Build or measure audiences;</p><p>• Provide more relevant marketing; and</p><p>• Understand interactions across websites, applications, or devices where permitted.</p><p> </p><p>Marketing cookies may be placed or accessed by third-party advertising and marketing providers.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law, marketing cookies will be used only after you provide consent.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_BMFrcn": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6. First-Party and Third-Party Cookies",
            "text": "<h3>6.1 First-Party Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>First-party cookies are set directly by PB Fulfill or through our website domain.</p><p> </p><p>They may be used for:</p><p> </p><p>• Essential website functions;</p><p>• Security;</p><p>• Privacy preferences;</p><p>• Forms;</p><p>• Account functionality;</p><p>• Website preferences; and</p><p>• Website measurement.</p><p> </p><h3>6.2 Third-Party Cookies</h3><p> </p><p>Third-party cookies are set or accessed by a service provider or other organization whose technology is used on our website.</p><p> </p><p>Depending on the services enabled on our website, third parties may include providers of:</p><p> </p><p>• Ecommerce and website infrastructure;</p><p>• Analytics;</p><p>• Advertising and marketing measurement;</p><p>• Embedded content;</p><p>• Customer communication;</p><p>• Reviews and reputation services;</p><p>• Security and fraud prevention; and</p><p>• Other website functionality.</p><p> </p><p>Third parties may process information according to their own privacy policies in addition to any contractual obligations they have to us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_hgGKFQ": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "7. Shopify Cookies and Technologies",
            "text": "<p></p><p>Our website is hosted and supported by Shopify.</p><p> </p><p>Shopify may use cookies and similar technologies to provide services including:</p><p> </p><p>• Website infrastructure;</p><p>• Security and fraud prevention;</p><p>• Storefront functionality;</p><p>• Customer accounts;</p><p>• Shopping-cart and checkout functionality where applicable;</p><p>• Analytics;</p><p>• Privacy preference management; and</p><p>• Transaction-related services.</p><p> </p><p>Depending on your location, the website features you use, and the settings enabled on our store, Shopify may process information such as:</p><p> </p><p>• IP address;</p><p>• Browser and device information;</p><p>• Cookie identifiers;</p><p>• Website activity;</p><p>• Account information;</p><p>• Contact details; and</p><p>• Transaction-related information.</p><p> </p><p>For more information about how Shopify handles personal information, please review the Shopify Consumer Privacy Policy:</p><p> </p><p>https://www.shopify.com/legal/privacy/consumers</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_iH6b3K": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "8. Other Third-Party Services",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>Our website may use or link to third-party services.</p><p> </p><p>These may include:</p><p> </p><p>• Communication services such as WhatsApp;</p><p>• Review and reputation services such as Trustpilot;</p><p>• Analytics services where enabled;</p><p>• Advertising and campaign-measurement services where enabled;</p><p>• Form or customer relationship management services;</p><p>• Embedded media or content providers; and</p><p>• Security or performance providers.</p><p> </p><p>Simply clicking a link to a third-party website is different from that third party placing a cookie on our website.</p><p> </p><p>When you leave our website and visit a third-party service, the third party may set its own cookies and process information according to its own privacy policy.</p><p> </p><p>The third-party providers used on our website may change as our website and services develop.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_ti9jrE": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "9. Cookie Consent and Your Choices",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>Where applicable law requires consent, we ask for your permission before using non-essential cookies for analytics, preferences, marketing, or similar purposes.</p><p> </p><p>Depending on your region, our cookie banner may allow you to:</p><p> </p><p>• Accept cookies;</p><p>• Reject non-essential cookies;</p><p>• Select particular categories; or</p><p>• Review or change your choices.</p><p> </p><p>Necessary cookies may remain active because they are required for website operation, security, or a service you request.</p><p> </p><p>Your choice may be stored so that we do not need to ask you again every time you visit.</p><p> </p><p>You may be asked to make a new choice if:</p><p> </p><p>• Your consent record expires;</p><p>• You clear your cookies or browser data;</p><p>• You use another browser or device;</p><p>• We materially change the technologies we use; or</p><p>• Applicable law requires us to request consent again.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_wrdDcV": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "10. How to Change or Withdraw Your Consent",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>Where a Cookie Preferences control is available on our website, you may use it to review or change your choices.</p><p> </p><p>You may also:</p><p> </p><p>• Clear cookies stored by your browser;</p><p>• Block all or some cookies;</p><p>• Configure your browser to notify you when cookies are placed;</p><p>• Use privacy controls supported by your browser; or</p><p>• Contact us with a privacy-related question.</p><p> </p><p>Withdrawing consent does not affect processing that lawfully occurred before consent was withdrawn.</p><p> </p><p>After consent is withdrawn, some previously stored cookies may remain on your browser until they expire or are manually deleted, but we will seek to stop using them for the withdrawn purpose where technically and legally applicable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_HEHz3P": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "11. Browser Settings",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>Most browsers allow you to manage cookies through their settings.</p><p> </p><p>Depending on your browser, you may be able to:</p><p> </p><p>• View stored cookies;</p><p>• Delete individual cookies;</p><p>• Clear all website data;</p><p>• Block third-party cookies;</p><p>• Block all cookies; or</p><p>• Allow cookies only for selected websites.</p><p> </p><p>Browser instructions vary. Please consult the privacy, security, or cookie section of your browser settings.</p><p> </p><p>Blocking or deleting cookies may affect:</p><p> </p><p>• Website preferences;</p><p>• Forms;</p><p>• Account access;</p><p>• Cart or checkout functionality;</p><p>• Website performance; and</p><p>• Other features.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_HWWpGb": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "12. Do Not Track and Browser Privacy Signals",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>Some browsers offer “Do Not Track” settings or other privacy preference signals.</p><p> </p><p>There is no single universally accepted standard for responding to all such signals.</p><p> </p><p>Where required by applicable law and supported by our systems, we may recognize certain legally applicable browser-based opt-out signals, such as Global Privacy Control.</p><p> </p><p>The availability and effect of these signals may depend on your region, browser, website configuration, and applicable law.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_fBLmrV": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "13. Cookie Duration",
            "text": "<p></p><p>The amount of time a cookie remains on your browser or device depends on its purpose and configuration.</p><p> </p><p>Cookies may be:</p><p> </p><p>• Session cookies, which generally expire when the browser session ends; or</p><p>• Persistent cookies, which remain for a specified period or until manually deleted.</p><p> </p><p>Retention periods may vary depending on:</p><p> </p><p>• The cookie’s purpose;</p><p>• Shopify or another provider’s configuration;</p><p>• Website and privacy settings;</p><p>• Security requirements; and</p><p>• Changes to the services used on our website.</p><p> </p><p>We periodically review the cookies and related technologies used on our website.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_9KCjcE": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "14. Personal Information Collected Through Cookies",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>Information collected through cookies and similar technologies may include:</p><p> </p><p>• IP address;</p><p>• Cookie or device identifier;</p><p>• Browser type;</p><p>• Device type;</p><p>• Operating system;</p><p>• Approximate location;</p><p>• Referring website;</p><p>• Pages viewed;</p><p>• Links or buttons clicked;</p><p>• Session time and duration;</p><p>• Website interactions;</p><p>• Campaign or referral information; and</p><p>• Security, diagnostic, and performance information.</p><p> </p><p>Where this information identifies or can reasonably be linked to an individual, we handle it as personal information in accordance with our Privacy Policy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_mUrxMx": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "15. Updates to This Cookie Policy",
            "text": "<p></p><p> </p><p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in:</p><p> </p><p>• Cookies and technologies used on our website;</p><p>• Shopify or other service providers;</p><p>• Website functionality;</p><p>• Business practices;</p><p>• Privacy settings; or</p><p>• Applicable legal requirements.</p><p> </p><p>When we update this Cookie Policy, we will publish the revised version on this page and update the “Last updated” date.</p><p> </p><p>We encourage you to review this Cookie Policy periodically.</p>"
          }
        },
